Source tapes/_settings.tape
Output out/02-watch-plan.mp4

Hide
Type "export PATH=$HOME/Documents/Repositories/chunk-cli/dist:$PATH && cd $HOME/Documents/Repositories/chunk-demos && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "chunk watch"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

# n = new plan
Type "n"
Sleep 2s
Type "build an HTML vanilla css  page with a red big button in it"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 8s
